---
import { PANEL_JSON_URL } from '../../lib/shareholders/types'
import {
  SORT_LABELS,
  TABLE_COLUMNS,
  tableEmptyRowHtml,
} from '../../lib/shareholders/table'
import { formatCount } from '../../lib/shareholders/view'

interface Props {
  years: number[]
  latestYear: number
  rowCount: number
  rowsHtml: string
}

const { years, latestYear, rowCount, rowsHtml } = Astro.props
const yearsDescending = [...years].sort((a, b) => b - a)
---

<section
  class="holder"
  data-holder-table
  aria-labelledby="holder-heading"
  data-endpoint={PANEL_JSON_URL}
  data-latest-year={latestYear}
  data-row-count={rowCount}
>
  <h2 id="holder-heading" class="sr-only">个股股东结构表</h2>

  <div class="holder-toolbar" data-holder-toolbar hidden>
    <div class="holder-search">
      <label class="holder-search__label" for="holder-search">搜索</label>
      <input
        id="holder-search"
        class="holder-search__input"
        type="search"
        placeholder="代码、简称或板块"
        autocomplete="off"
        autocapitalize="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        enterkeyhint="search"
        aria-describedby="holder-search-hint"
        aria-label="搜索股票代码、简称或板块"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="holder-year">
      <label class="holder-year__label" for="holder-year">年份</label>
      <select id="holder-year" class="holder-year__select" data-holder-year>
        {yearsDescending.map((year) => (
          <option value={year} selected={year === latestYear}>{year} 年末</option>
        ))}
      </select>
    </div>

    <p class="holder-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">
      <span data-holder-count>{formatCount(rowCount)}</span> 只
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="holder-hint" id="holder-search-hint" data-holder-hint hidden>
    点表头排序，点整行展开历年变化。
  </p>

  <noscript>
    <p class="holder-noscript">
      搜索、排序、切换年份和展开历史需要 JavaScript；下表已包含最新年末的全部公司，原始 CSV 可直接下载。
    </p>
  </noscript>

  <table class="holder-table">
    <caption class="sr-only" data-holder-caption>
      个股股东持股结构表。最新年末为 {latestYear} 年末，列有自然人、一般法人、专业机构、其他持股比例与合计持股数；各列可按升序或降序排列。
    </caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        {TABLE_COLUMNS.map((column) => (
          <th
            scope="col"
            class:list={[
              'holder-th',
              column.numeric && 'holder-th--num',
              column.className,
            ]}
            aria-sort={column.key === 'code' ? 'ascending' : 'none'}
            data-sort-th={column.key}
          >
            <button
              type="button"
              class="holder-th__button"
              data-sort={column.key}
              aria-label={`按${SORT_LABELS[column.key]}排序`}
            >
              <span>{column.label}</span>
              <span class="holder-th__mark" data-sort-mark aria-hidden="true">{column.key === 'code' ? '↑' : ''}</span>
            </button>
          </th>
        ))}
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody data-holder-body set:html={rowsHtml + tableEmptyRowHtml()} />
  </table>

  <p class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-holder-status></p>
</section>
